  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Improve the income verification process",
    "splashDescription": "This blueprint streamlines the process of verifying income, reducing processing time and ensuring regulatory compliance at every step. You can use this foundational blueprint by itself or in combination with other blueprints for consumer banking, commercial banking, wealth management, and so on. The blueprint automates the verification of income information, allowing for an efficient interaction between the application and the financial institution, from initial submission to final confirmation or rejection. Along the way, it ensures all steps adhere to regulatory standards. This blueprint leverages various components of Camunda, emphasizing development skills, best practices, and a solid architectural understanding.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/451492/overview/img1613537016889101807.png?aced94a76e180d313673114900945e7e",
